 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "A song of ascents from Solomon",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Unless the Lord builds the house",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Its builders labor in vain",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Unless the Lord watches over the city",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.82,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The watchman keeps guard in vain",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord builds the house",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord watches over the city",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our labor is vain without Him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gives us the victory",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In vain you rise early",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And stay up late to toil",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eating the bread of anxious work",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Trying to fulfill your goal",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the Lord gives sleep",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.06,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To the one he loves",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Resting in His sovereign grace",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Away from the waves",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord builds the house",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord watches over the city",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.66,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our labor is vain without Him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.55,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He gives us the victory",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Look, children are a heritage",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "From the Lord himself",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The fruit of the womb is a reward",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.09,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A blessing in life",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like arrows in the hand",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Of a warrior strong",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So are the sons of one's youth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Where they belong",
